---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
---

<Site
  page="privacy"
  title="Privacy Policy | Anchorline Systems"
  description="How Anchorline Systems handles information submitted through AnchorlineAI.com."
>
  <section class="container policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY POLICY</p>
    <h1>Privacy, in plain language.</h1>
    <p class="policy-review-note">
      This policy is a practical description of the website’s current behavior
      and is not legal advice.
    </p>
    <p class="policy-updated">Effective September 8, 2026</p>
    <div class="policy-copy">
      <section>
        <h2>What this site collects</h2><p>
          The Growth Audit form asks for your name, business email, company
          website, business type, and—if you choose to provide it—a short
          description of the growth problem you are trying to solve.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>How Anchorline uses it</h2><p>
          Anchorline uses submitted information to review your request,
          understand your business context, determine whether there may be a
          fit, and respond with an appropriate next step. Submitting a request
          does not create a client relationship or guarantee that Anchorline
          will offer an engagement.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>How the form is handled</h2><p>
          The form is processed through Netlify Forms. Submissions are recorded
          there, and the site is configured to notify Anchorline at
          hello@anchorlineai.com. Please do not submit passwords, credentials,
          confidential client information, or other sensitive material.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>
          At launch, this site does not include Google Analytics, Google Tag
          Manager, advertising pixels, session replay, or heatmap tools. If that
          changes, this policy should be updated to describe the tools actually
          in use.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Third-party links</h2><p>
          The site may link to third-party services, including the protected
          Anchorline client portal. Those services operate under their own terms
          and privacy practices.
        </p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2>Questions</h2><p>
          For questions about this policy or information submitted through the
          site, email <a href="mailto:hello@anchorlineai.com"
            >hello@anchorlineai.com</a
          >.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
